cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PlantHelixSeek, please cite the manuscript and the archived software."
title: "PlantHelixSeek: a plant DNA foundation model for transferable genome representation learning"
abstract: >-
  PlantHelixSeek is a 470M-parameter plant DNA foundation model trained with
  masked language modeling at single-nucleotide resolution on 53 plant genomes.
  The repository provides pre-training, fine-tuning and inference code, model
  cards, dataset cards and compute benchmarks.
type: software
